{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmhJATucqRUNkjv9P91S","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"From what the page shows, the cheapest account is פסגות. It charges about 1,058 ₪ over 10 years, and it's the one marked \"★ הזול\". But the page has no fund at all for \"test\", so it doesn't really answer which fund to buy. I'd open an account at פסגות and then I'm stuck. I'm only fairly sure about this.\n\n**What decided it:** the account list is sorted cheapest first. 1,058 ₪ was the first big number I saw and it's way below the rest (1,303, 2,759, 4,547…). Also פסגות is a name I know.\n\n**Where I looked, in order:**\n- **Top of the page.** Heading \"איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד, לאורך זמן\". My \"test\" button is there and selected.\n- **Sliders.** They're set to 10,000 ₪ now, 500 a month, 10 years, 7%. Those aren't my numbers, and this task didn't give any amounts, so I didn't touch them.\n- **\"כמה נשאר בסוף תלוי בקרן\".** It says \"האתר לא אסף קרנות על test\" and has a button \"+ הוספת קרן שלא ברשימה\". On the left, \"עוד לא נבחרה קרן\" and \"אין עדיין קרנות ברשימה\". So the cheapest fund for test is up to me to look up. I didn't add one.\n- **\"כל החשבונות\".** I read the first line, that it's sorted by what each account charges. Then I scrolled the list: פסגות 1,058, אינטראקטיב ישראל 1,303, Interactive Brokers 2,759, לאומי 4,547… all the way down to מיטב טרייד and אקסלנס at around 26,800 ₪. Those are in red, so I'd stay away from them.\n- **Lower down.** I scrolled past \"מה כתוב בפרסום, מול התעריפון\" and the grey notes at the bottom without reading them. I'd really have stopped after the list.\n\n**Words I didn't get:**\n- \"דמי משמרת\", from the colour legend under the list. I skipped it.\n- The coloured bars. I guessed orange is \"עמלות קנייה ומכירה\" and yellow is דמי משמרת. I only glanced at the legend.\n- \"לא בחישוב\" next to the special prices. I take it these prices aren't counted.\n- \"קרן מחקה\" vs \"בחו\"ל\". I'm not sure if that's the same thing.\n\n**Where I hesitated:**\n- I'm not sure whether 1,058 ₪ already includes the fund's fee or only the account's. No fund is chosen, so maybe the real cost is higher.\n- The grey bit near the top says \"האתר לא ממליץ על מדד\", but פסגות is still marked \"הזול\". So which is it, a recommendation or not?\n- Seeing \"אין עדיין קרנות ברשימה\" with no fund to pick is where I'd have felt like closing the page."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3801,"cache_read_input_tokens":11808,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3801},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"500e4829-265c-4247-9e37-31ba826596bd","uuid":"1fd9e697-e8d1-4d78-b484-bc1581ea49cb","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:44:38.747Z","request_id":"req_011CgmhJAEmPxXBJLfTprN5Z"}
